  undesired:
    - The shallow mode reads file contents, silently turning a cheap map call into an unpredictable expense.
    - A path-scoped call omits the ancestor chain and forces the agent to manually walk upward to reconstruct inherited context.
    - Misalignment flags block the call or require remediation before the response returns — the flag is informational, never a gate.
    - Output drowns aligned/misaligned signals in noise — rendering "pending" on every unreviewed spec, trailing em-dashes on empty summaries.
